        },
        {
          "text": "Jumiru, wuwinj dwand judongo m’i wiwu ma ku kum i gin ceke; ku tic ma ku wang’ ungo, calu ma dhanu maru, ento kud adunde acel, mi lworo Rwoth: ",
          "type": "text",
